---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /privacy-policy/
title: Privacy Policy
description: Privacy policy for Signature Therapeutic Wellness.
---
<section class="px-6 pt-40 pb-28 sm:pt-48">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-espresso-400">Last updated {{ "now" | currentYear }}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-espresso-500">
      <p>Signature Therapeutic Wellness ("we," "us," "our") respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect through this website and how we use it.</p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-espresso-700">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">When you contact us through this website or by email, we collect the information you provide, such as your name, email address, phone number, and any message content — including insurance card details you choose to send us for coverage verification.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-espresso-700">Booking & Payments</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Appointments and gift card purchases are processed through Square, a third-party payment and scheduling provider. Square's own privacy policy governs the information you provide during booking or checkout.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-espresso-700">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We use the information you provide to respond to inquiries, schedule appointments, verify insurance coverage, and communicate with you about your care. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-espresso-700">Data Retention</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We retain client information for as long as necessary to provide services and meet recordkeeping obligations, including those required for insurance billing.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-espresso-700">Your Choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">You may ask us to update or delete the personal information we hold about you by contacting us using the details below.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-espresso-700">Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          {{ site.address.line1 }}, {{ site.address.line2 }}<br>
          <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="text-sage-600 underline underline-offset-4">{{ site.phone }}</a><br>
          <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="text-sage-600 underline underline-offset-4">{{ site.email }}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
